ated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-d6aa6a2 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"d6aa6a2\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h3 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\"><a href=\"https:\/\/womgroup.com\/location\/magnum-forge-machine-works\/\">Magnum Forge and Machine Works (MFMW)<\/a><\/h3>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-4679326 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"4679326\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Magnum Forge is a manufacturer of open die and closed die forgings, engaged in manufacturing Oilfield and Power Transmission Components in various grades like low and medium carbon steel, alloy steel, stainless steel, Inconel, 17-5PH, duplex and super duplex.<\/p><p>The plant is ISO 9001 and PED 97\/23\/EC certified and fortified with experienced technocrats. The management and workforce of Magnum Forge adhere strict quality control procedures that conform to the highest standards set by the industry. The plant has an annual capacity to forge more than 25,000 tons, ensuring quick delivery and competitive pricing.<\/p><p>Besides providing the highest quality forgings, Magnum Forge has significantly contributed towards reducing the delivery time. Close Die Forging capabilities helped WOM reduce delivery time by\u00a0as much as <strong>SIX weeks<\/strong>.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/section>\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-e16a8bf elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default\" data-